     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p class=\"res-header-id\">\n              <b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem search-processingmode</b>\n            </p>\n            <a name=\"search-processingmode\"> </a>\n            <a name=\"hcsearch-processingmode\"> </a>\n            <p>This case-sensitive code system \n              <code>http://hl7.org/fhir/search-processingmode</code> defines the following codes:\n            </p>\n            <table class=\"codes\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                  <b>Code</b>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <b>Display</b>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <b>Definition</b>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">normal\n                  <a name=\"search-processingmode-normal\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Normal</td>\n                <td>The search parameter is derived directly from the selected nodes based on the type definitions.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">phonetic\n                  <a name=\"search-processingmode-phonetic\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Phonetic</td>\n                <td>The search parameter is derived by a phonetic transform from the selected nodes.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other\n                  <a name=\"search-processingmode-other\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Other</td>\n                <td>The interpretation of the xpath statement is unknown (and can't be automated).</td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
