     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p class=\"res-header-id\">\n              <b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem document-reference-status</b>\n            </p>\n            <a name=\"document-reference-status\"> </a>\n            <a name=\"hcdocument-reference-status\"> </a>\n            <p>This case-sensitive code system \n              <code>http://hl7.org/fhir/document-reference-status</code> defines the following codes:\n            </p>\n            <table class=\"codes\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                  <b>Code</b>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <b>Display</b>\n                </td>\n                <td>\n                  <b>Definition</b>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">current\n                  <a name=\"document-reference-status-current\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Current</td>\n                <td>This is the current reference for this document.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">superseded\n                  <a name=\"document-reference-status-superseded\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Superseded</td>\n                <td>This reference has been superseded by another reference.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">entered-in-error\n                  <a name=\"document-reference-status-entered-in-error\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Entered in Error</td>\n                <td>This reference was created in error.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">unknown\n                  <a name=\"document-reference-status-unknown\"> </a>\n                </td>\n                <td>Unknown</td>\n                <