     fhir:definition [ fhir:v "The imaging selection has been withdrawn following a release.  This electronic record should never have existed, though it is possible that real-world decisions were based on it. (If real-world activity has occurred, the status should be \"inactive\" rather than \"entered-in-error\".)." ]
