  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p class=\"res-header-id\">\n              <b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet nutrition-product-category</b>\n            </p>\n            <a name=\"nutrition-product-category\"> </a>\n            <a name=\"hcnutrition-product-category\"> </a>\n            <p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Import all the codes that are contained in \n                <a href=\"valueset-modified-foodtype.html\">Texture Modified Food Type Codes</a>\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 226789007 (Breast milk)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 412413001 (Infant formula (product))\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 346415002 (Enteral+supplement feeds)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 226465004 (Drinks)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 890302005 (Potable water (substance))\n              </li>\n              <li>Include these codes as defined in \n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span>\n                <table class=\"none\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                      <b>Code</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Display</b>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/11713004\">11713004</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Water</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://snomed.info/id/444923006\">444923006</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Tap water</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
  ] ; # 
