  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p class=\"res-header-id\">\n              <b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet observation-vitalsign-systolicbp</b>\n            </p>\n            <a name=\"observation-vitalsign-systolicbp\"> </a>\n            <a name=\"hcobservation-vitalsign-systolicbp\"> </a>\n            <p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://loinc.org\">\n                  <code>http://loinc.org</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where COMPONENT  in LP72836-7,LP304522-8,LP304524-4,LP304523-6,LP304513-7, PROPERTY  = LP6847-0 (Pres), TIME_ASPCT  = LP6960-1 (Pt), SYSTEM  = LP7034-4 (Arterial system) and SCALE_TYP  = LP7753-9 (Qn)\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>This value set excludes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Exclude these codes as defined in \n                <a href=\"http://loinc.org\">\n                  <code>http://loinc.org</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span>\n                <table class=\"none\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                      <b>Code</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Display</b>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"https://loinc.org/8479-8/\">8479-8</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>Systolic blood pressure by palpation</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
  ] ; # 
