rough the package references\"> version ?3.0.0</span>\n                <table class=\"none\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                      <b>Code</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Display</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Definition</b>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-hl7TermMaintInfra.html#hl7TermMaintInfra-preferredForLanguage\">preferredForLanguage</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Preferred For Language</td>\n                    <td>Denotes a code designation which is preferred for the identified language among more than one for that language. Used in value set designation-use in FHIR.</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
