  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p class=\"res-header-id\">\n              <b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet encounter-participant-type</b>\n            </p>\n            <a name=\"encounter-participant-type\"> </a>\n            <a name=\"hcencounter-participant-type\"> </a>\n            <p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ParticipationType</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 7.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?7.0.0</span> where concept  is-a \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html#v3-ParticipationType-_ParticipationAncillary\">_ParticipationAncillary</a>\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ParticipationType</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 7.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?7.0.0</span> where concept  is-a \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html#v3-ParticipationType-LOC\">LOC</a>\n              </li>\n              <li>Include all codes defined in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-participant-type.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/participant-type</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 1.0.1, the version found through the package references\"> version ?1.0.1</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>This value set excludes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Exclude these codes as defined in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ParticipationType</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 7.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?7.0.0</span>\n                <table class=\"none\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                      <b>Code</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Display</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Definition</b>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html#v3-ParticipationType-_ParticipationAncillary\">_ParticipationAncillary</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"color: #cccccc\">ParticipationAncillary</td>\n                    <td>Participations related, but not primary to an act. The Referring, Admitting, and Discharging practitioners must be the same person as those authoring the ControlAct event for their respective trigger events.</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-ParticipationType.html#v3-ParticipationType-ELOC\">ELOC</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"color: #cccccc\">entry location</td>\n                    <td>A location where data about an Act was entered.</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
  ] ; # 
