  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p class=\"res-header-id\">\n              <b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet observation-vitalsign-bodyheight</b>\n            </p>\n            <a name=\"observation-vitalsign-bodyheight\"> </a>\n            <a name=\"hcobservation-vitalsign-bodyheight\"> </a>\n            <p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://loinc.org\">\n                  <code>http://loinc.org</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where CLASS  in LP7768-7,LP7769-5, PROPERTY  = LP6822-3 (Len), TIME_ASPCT  = LP6960-1 (Pt), SYSTEM  = LP310005-6 (^Patient) and SCALE_TYP  = LP7753-9 (Qn)\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>This value set excludes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Exclude codes from\n                <a href=\"http://loinc.org\">\n                  <code>http://loinc.org</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where COMPONENT  = LP343922-3 (Upper segment)\n              </li>\n              <li>Exclude codes from\n                <a href=\"http://loinc.org\">\n                  <code>http://loinc.org</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where COMPONENT  = LP343921-5 (Lower segment)\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
  ] ; # 
