     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p class=\"res-header-id\">\n              <b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet use-context</b>\n            </p>\n            <a name=\"use-context\"> </a>\n            <a name=\"hcuse-context\"> </a>\n            <p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Import all the codes that are contained in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/ValueSet-v2-0265.html\">hl7VS-specialtyType</a>\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 394733009 (Medical specialties)\n              </li>\n              <li>Include all codes defined in \n                <a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r5\">\n                  <code>urn:iso:std:iso:3166</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span>\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <code>http://unstats.un.org/unsd/methods/m49/m49.htm</code>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where class  = region\n              </li>\n              <li>Include codes from\n                <a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\">\n                  <code>http://snomed.info/sct</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where concept  is-a 387961004 (Kingdom Animalia (organism))\n              </li>\n              <li>Import all the codes that are contained in \n                <a href=\"valueset-administrative-gender.html\">AdministrativeGender</a>\n              </li>\n              <li>Import all the codes that are contained in \n                <a href=\"valueset-condition-code.html\">Condition/Problem/Diagnosis Codes</a>\n              </li>\n              <li>Include all codes defined in \n                <a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r5\">\n                  <code>http://nucc.org/provider-taxonomy</code>\n                </a>\n                <span style=\"opacity: 0.5\" title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. When building this specification, the most recent version 22.1 has been used\"> version ⏿22.1</span>\n              </li>\n              <li>Import all the codes that are contained in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/ValueSet-v3-ActEncounterCode.html\">ActEncounterCode</a>\n              </li>\n              <li>Import all the codes that are contained in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/ValueSet-v3-ActTaskCode.html\">ActTaskCode</a>\n              </li>\n              <li>Import all the codes that are contained in \n                <a href=\"valueset-usage-context-agreement-scope.html\">Usage Context Agreement Scope</a>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
