     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <p class=\"res-header-id\">\n              <b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet adverse-event-category</b>\n            </p>\n            <a name=\"adverse-event-category\"> </a>\n            <a name=\"hcadverse-event-category\"> </a>\n            <p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Include all codes defined in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-adverse-event-category.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/adverse-event-category</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 3.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?3.0.0</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n            <p>This value set excludes codes based on the following rules:</p>\n            <ul>\n              <li>Exclude these codes as defined in \n                <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-adverse-event-category.html\">\n                  <code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/adverse-event-category</code>\n                </a>\n                <span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 3.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?3.0.0</span>\n                <table class=\"none\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">\n                      <b>Code</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Display</b>\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                      <b>Definition</b>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                  <tr>\n                    <td>\n                      <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-adverse-event-category.html#adverse-event-category-hospital-aquired-infection\">hospital-aquired-infection</a>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Hospital Acquired Infection</td>\n                    <td>The adverse event pertains to a hospital acquired infection.</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
  ] ; # 
